        <item>
            <key> <string>description</string> </key>
            <value> <string>Update an already-installed Business Template from the shared git working copy.\n
\n
Runs the same validation, snapshot, and ERP5 import machinery as\n
erp5_bt_install_from_repository, but invokes ERP5\'s standard \'update from repository\'\n
behaviour (diff of the previous installed version, keep/modify decision).\n
\n
Before applying, checks the two-way diff (baseline/HEAD vs repository vs installed\n
ERP5) and REJECTS with synchronization_conflict when changes exist on both the\n
repository and the ERP5 side for the same objects, unless force=true is passed\n
explicitly. FAILS with not_installed if the template is not installed, and suggests\n
erp5_bt_install_from_repository.\n
\n
Requires development permissions (Manager). All synchronous ZODB changes commit or\n
abort together with the surrounding request transaction.\n
\n
Returns JSON with: success, operation=\'update\', business_template, created, modified,\n
deleted, revision.\n
</string> </value>
